    "This Mac goes back to how it was on %@, when your assistant moved. What happened on your home server since then is lost. Only do this if your home server is gone: two copies must never run at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac goes back to how it was on %@, when your assistant moved. What happened on your home server since then is lost. Only do this if your home server is gone: two copies must never run at once."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este Mac vuelve a como estaba el %@, cuando se trasladó tu asistente. Se pierde lo ocurrido en tu servidor doméstico desde entonces. Hazlo solo si tu servidor doméstico ya no existe: nunca deben ejecutarse dos copias a la vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
