    "Your assistant gets its own Sphinx account, made from your words, and becomes a contact you message from this Mac or your phone. Setting it up costs up to %@ from your balance: %@ to open its account and %@ to add it as a contact." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your assistant gets its own Sphinx account, made from your words, and becomes a contact you message from this Mac or your phone. Setting it up costs up to %1$@ from your balance: %2$@ to open its account and %3$@ to add it as a contact."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu asistente obtiene su propia cuenta de Sphinx, creada a partir de tus palabras, y se convierte en un contacto al que escribes desde este Mac o tu teléfono. Configurarlo cuesta hasta %1$@ de tu saldo: %2$@ para abrir su cuenta y %3$@ para añadirlo como contacto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
